  "description": "A low-level, pure-Rust library providing constant-time primitives and traits for side-channel resistant cryptographic implementations. It implements a 'Choice' type and various traits to replace boolean branching with bitwise operations and optimization barriers, aiming to mitigate timing attacks in software.",
